OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric fair marks start of
OL,4,Aautumn season
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Oxford's oldest traditions has
OL,7,Freturned to the city centre this week -
OL,8,Fmarking the start of a busy season of
OL,9,Ffairs across the county.
OL,11,FSt Giles' Fair, which takes over St
OL,12,FGiles and Magdalen Street every
OL,13,FSeptember, is running from 11:00 to
OL,14,F23:00 BST on Monday and Tuesday this
OL,15,Fweek.
OL,17,FThe fair has been a fixture in Oxford
OL,18,Ffor centuries and is believed to be one
OL,19,Fof the largest of its kind in Europe.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
